# FFmpeg configure flags for windows-x64 and windows-arm64 (lane B4c; docs/05 §4.1, §4.3).
# Added to ffmpeg.common.flags. Hardware decode through D3D11VA, D3D12VA, DXVA2
# and Vulkan; Media Foundation (mfplat.dll loaded at runtime) and D3D12 encoders
# for cast transcoding; TLS from Schannel only.
--target-os=win64
--toolchain=msvc
--enable-w32threads
--enable-d3d11va
--enable-d3d12va
--enable-dxva2
--enable-mediafoundation
--enable-schannel
--enable-zlib
--enable-bzlib
--enable-lzma
